      "type": "briefing",
      "sentences": [
        "Anthropic's IPO preparations dominated the week, reframing who actually wins when a frontier lab goes public — and the answer may be Amazon more than the VCs.",
        "Google kept shipping: the Genie 4 world model gained audio and real-time steering while Gemini and Search opened to more outside apps.",
