        "General Compute's $100M Series A and Disruptive's $10B fund said the money has not slowed, whatever the neocloud pessimists claim.",
        "The discourse turned on accountability: parents suing OpenAI, a research firm calling the Anthropic IPO a test of investor gullibility, and a week of 'who's really in charge' coverage.",
        "Underneath it all, the browser became an AI surface — Chrome's Autofill reads Gmail, Opera proposed a local-AI standard, and agents reshaped what a web app even is."
